          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "реферат (referát) was borrowed from German Referat (EtymDB), which is usually traced to Latin referat \"let him report\", a form of referre \"to bring back, to report\" (Lewis & Short)."
