          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "презентация (prezentátsiya) is usually traced, through western languages, to Late Latin praesentātiō \"a showing\", from praesentāre \"to show\", built on praesēns \"present, at hand\" (Lewis & Short)."
