              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "понятие (ponyátiye) — \"a concept, a notion\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Я не имею понятия, где он. Ya ne iméyu ponyátiya, gde on. I have no idea where he is."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter. Не иметь понятия — to have no idea."
            }
          ]
        },
