          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "понятие (ponyátiye) is built on понять \"to understand\", from по- and the old verb \"to take\" that also stands in снимать and занимать: a concept is what the mind takes hold of."
            }
          ]
        },
